    18	% OUTPUTS:
    19	% out       = Output following alignment of averages.
    20	% fs        = Vector of frequency shifts (in Hz) used for alignment.
    21	% phs       = Vector of phase shifts (in degrees) used for alignment.
    22	% w         = Vector of relative weights applied to the individual
